    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20c7961bd3705694e5ce837",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈……哈……♪\r\n再来一圈……呀啊啊啊啊？！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17955cbcfc37b8d4477daebacf153f588e2f2fc92c7be7c84d6c4cf9d27b9a36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:127d9094ca98423c93e70110",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便只是想着拉面，她也能露出这般明媚的笑容；\r\n而我能做到的……便是让她这三年中的每一个瞬\r\n间，都如现在这般美妙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01df6905576b00b05fe4b32b9e47fc4b3be4181ffc62a4e79f576787c81251f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d9e446e46bd3047b8df4f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……也许她的确是天赋异禀吧。\r\n无论是调动全身肌肉的方法还是奔跑的速度，\r\n都让人一眼难忘。更何况——",
      "source_fingerprint": "35d91d2fa3441199850e743c4d7efc91f2b9c308c21f584041e163946c1071e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912e331b1b6475e8f168e802",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势",
