    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822362e2a7a9eeb4687f2829",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——她的心态才是她最大的优点。\r\n美妙姿势彻彻底底地享受着奔跑带来的乐趣。\r\n这样的心态无疑能成为有力的武器，只是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d98546f1fa89806b2d199515cc72616fcc1243a80e7fe932b55ece5180099a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
