      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年，美妙姿势将会步入经典级战线。\r\n正当我思考着要与她商量接下来准备进\r\n军怎样的比赛时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d886ae71661066cdbaf376139b953b1230e3185e8bab90cf29780816777ce3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022101.json",
